                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I came from Basuria/Szechuan, I like the version 2 of this game very much, it is so amazing KOEI did so many things in this little game, you can expand the city, you can rebel, and you can leave your lord :) Thank you for accompanying me during my college years. Due to the college expansion, China's colleges were messes, they let unqualified students in and destroyed everything, 4,500 students packed into a hall and if you were not sitting in the front row then you couldn't hear anything. And those poor students played Startcraft, Warcraft, counterstrikes. I am glad I was able to meet this game with the Uncharted Waters. \n\nThank you Koei! And shame to those Chinese who didn't pay but call you Dark Shame which is the opposite of 光榮",
